    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-αύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαιρέω</span>
			, <i>destroy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν Μῶσαν καταύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					95
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαῦσαι: ἀφανίσαι, καταῦσαι:
