				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔω</span> (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span>- (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ</span>- (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-αύω</span>.</div>
